# Re-generated at every build from in-repo data:
# - events.json + calendar.ics are derived from docs/data/events/<slug>.json
#   (the committed iCal sync cache) so they don't need to be versioned.
# - citations.json IS committed — it captures the last known verification
#   state from util/.event_evidence_cache.json, which is also committed.
manual-dump/
# Local working state for the manual page-dump workflow (see
# util/manual_dump.py) — human-saved browser snapshots for citation URLs
# no automated fetch can reach. Never committed: the durable, shareable
# archive of a citation is Wayback Machine, not this. util/import_manual_dump.py
# distills whatever's useful out of it into the committed evidence cache.
